//news.livedoor.com/topics/detail/32370734/","outlet":"ライブドアニュース (via Bing News search)","lang":"ja","via":"search","state":false,"nc":true,"title_en":"He warned Genta KOSEI, who won the election for the first time, of a bomb threat and demanded his resignation as governor of Okinawa Prefecture.","summary_en":"Mr. Genta KOSEI Okinawa Prefecture On 19 October, Mr. Gento KOSEI who was elected for the first time in the governor's election published a comment on his official homepage that he had received threats to resign from the position of governor and to blow up schools or prefectural offices related to his family if he did not do so. He said that he has consulted with police and is under investigation. According to this comment, there were threats of murder against Mr. Kosei and his family as well as threats of damaging public facilities and businesses within the province.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"Bomb threats made against Okinawa-gov. elect after election win","summary":"Governor-elect of Okinawa Prefecture Genta Koja said Saturday that bomb threats were sent to his children's schools and the prefectura ...","date":"2026-09-19T18:44","link":"https://mainichi.jp/english/articles/20260920/p2g/00m/0na/002000c","outlet":"The Mainichi (via Bing News search)","lang":"en","via":"search","state":false,"nc":true,"title_en":"Bomb threats made against Okinawa-gov. elect after election win","summary_en":"Governor-elect of Okinawa Prefecture Genta Koja said Saturday that bomb threats were sent to his children's schools and the prefectura ...","mt":null,"geo":null},{"title":"沖縄県知事選で初当選した古謝氏に爆破予告 知事の就任を辞退するよう求める内容","summary":"沖縄県知事選で初当選した古謝玄太氏は19日、「学校や県庁を爆破する」という趣旨の脅迫が寄せられたと明らかにしました。 知事の就任を辞退するよう求める内容だということです。 古謝氏や家族に対する殺害予告のほか、公共施設などに危害を加えるとする内容も複数回届いているということです。 すでに警察に相談していて、現在捜査が進められています。 ...","date":"2026-09-19T18:04","link":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/c487e6dfe837beb674c06e8a3189c3c052053b20","outlet":"Yahoo!ニュース (via Bing News search)","lang":"ja","via":"search","state":false,"nc":true,"title_en":"A warning letter to Mr. Kosei, who was elected governor of Okinawa Prefecture for the first time, requesting him to resign from his position as governor","summary_en":"Mr. Gensaku Genta, who was first elected in the Okinawa prefectural governor election, revealed on the 19th that a threat was received with the purpose of \"blowing up schools and prefectural offices\". That is to say, it is a request to decline the governor's appointment. In addition to predicting the murder of Mr. Furuya and his family, there have also been multiple reports of harm to public facilities. We have already consulted with the police and are currently investigating....","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"【沖縄県知事選】当選者と家族への「爆破予告」が突きつけるもの","summary":"2026年9月13日に投開票が行われた沖縄県知事選挙は、新人の古謝玄太氏が42万票を超える過去最多得票を獲得し、現職の玉城デニー氏に約14万7000票の大差をつけて初当選を果たすという結果になりました。 県政の行方を左右する激しい選挙戦を経て、県民の意思が示されました。 しかし、その直後に届いた報道は、民主主義社会において断じて看過できない極めて陰湿かつ凶悪なものでした。 古謝氏の子供たちが通う複 ...","date":"2026-09-19T16:12","link":"https://note.com/holy_honest6096/n/nf42c55ba9321","outlet":"note (via Bing News search)","lang":"ja","via":"search","state":false,"nc":true,"title_en":"The 'explosion warning' to the winner and his family","summary_en":"The Okinawa Prefectural Governor election, which was held on September 13, 2006, resulted in the newly elected Genta Kosei obtaining more than 420,000 votes, a record number of votes ever received by an official candidate, and beating current governor Denny Tamashiro by about 147,001 votes. After a fierce electoral campaign that determined the fate of the prefecture's government, the people of the province expressed their will. However, immediately afterwards, reports were sent to us that were extremely gloomy and vicious, and cannot be ignored in a democratic society.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"事件・事